OL,3,GNEWSAGreenock homes built with unsafe
OL,4,ARaac to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven blocks of flats in Greenock are
OL,7,Fto be demolished after they were found
OL,8,Fto contain potentially dangerous
OL,9,Fconcrete.
OL,11,FThe properties, on Belville Street,
OL,12,Fcontain Raac - reinforced autoclaved
OL,13,Faerated concrete - and now River Clyde
OL,14,FHomes (RCH) has said they have to be
OL,15,Fknocked down.
OL,17,FThe Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,18,Fpreviously warned that Raac was now
OL,19,Fbeyond its lifespan and could "collapse
OL,20,Fwith little or no notice".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
